Setup			p3disof

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.1             Midplane scale height
AspectRatio2		0.1             Atmosphere scale height
Sigma0			1.0		Surface Density at r=1
#Nu			1.0e-5		Uniform kinematic viscosity
Alpha			1.0e-3
SigmaSlope		1.5		Slope of surface
FlaringIndex		0.25
FlaringIndex2           0.25
TauDamp			0.01
Tcool                   1.0e-6
Rc                      2.0
Gamma                   1.4
Densflr                 1.0e-15
SelfConsistent          0               0 if zq=3H            
Height                  38.220155       Height of temperature transition (only used if SelfConsistent is 1)
Z0Slope                 1.059203        Slope of transition height

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/zero.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.13		Smoothing parameters in disk thickness
MassTaper               628.3185307179587

### Numerical method parameters
Strat                   YES
Disk			YES
OmegaFrame     		0.0
Frame			C
IndirectTerm		Yes
Eccentricity            0.0

### Dust parameters

Invstokes1		1.0e6           Inverse of the Stokes number for dust1
Invstokes2		1.0e3    	Inverse of the Stokes number for dust2
Invstokes3		1.0e2    	Inverse of the Stokes number for dust3
Invstokes4		1.0e1	    	Inverse of the Stokes number for dust4

Epsilon                 1.0    		Dust-to-gas mass ratio
Epsilon_init		0.1 		Initial midplane dust-to-gas ratio

### Mesh parameters

Nx			880             Azimuthal number of zones 
Ny                      369		Radial number of zones
Nz			56		Number of zones in colatitude
Ymin			0.3		Inner boundary radius
Ymax			5.0		Outer boundary radius
Zmin		        1.1707963267948966
Zmax			1.5707963267948966
Xmin                    -3.141592653589793
Xmax                    3.141592653589793
Spacing			Log

### Output control parameters

Ntot			2000			Total number of time steps
Ninterm	 		20			Time steps between outputs
DT			3.141592653589793  	Time step length. 2PI = 1 orbit
OutputDir		@outputs/p3disof
Field 			gasdens
PlotLine		field[-1,:,:]
